{"id":"3cde9144a38c16df","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-finite-presentation.md","title":"Finite Presentation","display":"df-finite-presentation — Finite Presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finite-presentation","aliases":["58-df-finite-presentation"],"display":"df-finite-presentation — Finite Presentation","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finite-presentation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finite-presentation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-presentation — Finite Presentation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> (group predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S\\)</span> (free-group coding predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S\\)</span> (finite-presentation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}group\\text{-}on}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\star)\n\\land1_F\\in F\n\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(1_F\\star x=x\\land x\\star1_F=x)\n\\land\\iota\\in F^S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall H,\\diamond\\in V\\;\\forall u\\in H^S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\diamond)\n\\to\\exists!\\widehat u\\in H^F\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\widehat u(\\iota(s))=u(s)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\widehat u(x\\star y)=\\widehat u(x)\\diamond\\widehat u(y)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}group\\text{-}on}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\star)\n\\land1_F\\in F\n\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(1_F\\star x=x\\land x\\star1_F=x)\n\\land\\iota\\in F^S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall H,\\diamond\\in V\\;\\forall u\\in H^S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\diamond)\n\\to\\exists!\\widehat u\\in H^F\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\widehat u(\\iota(s))=u(s)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\widehat u(x\\star y)=\\widehat u(x)\\diamond\\widehat u(y)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists S,F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,R,\\pi,e_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\\land R\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\n\\land\\pi\\in G^F\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\pi(x\\star y)=\\pi(x)\\cdot\\pi(y)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists x\\in F\\;\\pi(x)=g\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\{x\\in F\\mid\\pi(x)=e_G\\}\n=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{N\\subseteq F\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nR\\subseteq N\\land 1_F\\in N\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x\\star y\\in N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;\\exists y\\in N\\;(x\\star y=1_F\\land y\\star x=1_F)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\n\\bigl((a\\star b=1_F\\land b\\star a=1_F)\\to(a\\star x)\\star b\\in N\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists S,F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,R,\\pi,e_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\\land R\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\n\\land\\pi\\in G^F\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\pi(x\\star y)=\\pi(x)\\cdot\\pi(y)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists x\\in F\\;\\pi(x)=g\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\{x\\in F\\mid\\pi(x)=e_G\\}\n=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{N\\subseteq F\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nR\\subseteq N\\land 1_F\\in N\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x\\star y\\in N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;\\exists y\\in N\\;(x\\star y=1_F\\land y\\star x=1_F)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\n\\bigl((a\\star b=1_F\\land b\\star a=1_F)\\to(a\\star x)\\star b\\in N\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The identities of both groups and every inverse used in the normal-closure clause are explicitly bound; the formerly primitive presentation relation is thus replaced by a universal-property free group and a finite relator set whose normal closure is exactly the kernel of the quotient map.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$ (group predicate; see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate; see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}group\\text{-}on}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\star)\n\\land1_F\\in F\n\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(1_F\\star x=x\\land x\\star1_F=x)\n\\land\\iota\\in F^S\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall H,\\diamond\\in V\\;\\forall u\\in H^S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\diamond)\n\\to\\exists!\\widehat u\\in H^F\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall s\\in S\\;\\widehat u(\\iota(s))=u(s)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\widehat u(x\\star y)=\\widehat u(x)\\diamond\\widehat u(y)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyPresented}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists S,F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,R,\\pi,e_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeGroupOn}_S(F,\\star,1_F,\\iota,S)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\\land R\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\n\\land\\pi\\in G^F\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\pi(x\\star y)=\\pi(x)\\cdot\\pi(y)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists x\\in F\\;\\pi(x)=g\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\{x\\in F\\mid\\pi(x)=e_G\\}\n=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{N\\subseteq F\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nR\\subseteq N\\land 1_F\\in N\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x\\star y\\in N)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;\\exists y\\in N\\;(x\\star y=1_F\\land y\\star x=1_F)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\n\\bigl((a\\star b=1_F\\land b\\star a=1_F)\\to(a\\star x)\\star b\\in N\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2422,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-528","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-finite-presentation.md|58-df-finite-presentation]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}